<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do before</i> or <i>beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χρηστὰ ἔς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.41
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαθεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				54.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				38.11
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ διαφθαρῆναι . . , ἀλλὰ προποιῆσαι</span>”
				<i>make the first move,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ-πεποιημένα</span>”
				<i>works already carried out,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					7.3073.27
				</span></i>
			(Lebad., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make beforehand, prepare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεπεποίητο αὐτῷ προεξέδρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγίειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.833
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
